1.4.2 Extracting Date Components:  
-- PostgreSQL Method 1: EXTRACT(field FROM date_column), eg: SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date);  
Method 2: DATE_PART('field', date_column), eg: Extracting year DATE_PART('year', lastaccessdate);  
-- SQL Server  
SELECT DATEPART(YEAR, order_date);

1.2.2 Identifier Quoting (Object Names):
-- MySQL, SQLite (backticks ``` in default mode) SELECT `name`, `group` FROM `users`;
-- PostgreSQL, SQL Server (when QUOTED_IDENTIFIER is ON), Oracle (highly recommended) SELECT "name", "group" FROM "users";

